{#- facts: list of {text?, icon?, mono?, label?, markup?, elapsed?, frozen_at?}, spaced by gaps, never by middle dots. `markup` is a macro's output printed after the text, for a figure a live update replaces by its own id. `label` names the figure in `markup` as a word of its own, so a long figure wraps beside it and the label does not break. The space after the label is dropped in the inline-flex fact, so the gap alone spaces the two. `elapsed` marks an elapsed time: it holds the time of a drop, hidden until the connection controller shows it. `frozen_at` shows that time as given, with no target. -#}
<p class="meta">
    {%- for fact in facts -%}
        <span{% if fact.mono|default(false) %} class="mono"{% endif %}>
            {%- if fact.icon is defined %}{{ include('dashboard/components/icon.html.twig', {name: fact.icon, small: true}, with_context = false) }}{% endif %}
            {{- fact.text ?? '' -}}
            {%- if fact.label is defined %}<span class="fact-label">{{ fact.label }}</span> {% endif -%}
            {%- if fact.markup is defined %}{{ fact.markup }}{% endif -%}
            {%- if fact.frozen_at is defined %}<span class="frozen-at">at {{ fact.frozen_at }}</span>
            {%- elseif fact.elapsed|default(false) %}<span class="frozen-at" data-connection-target="frozen" hidden></span>{% endif -%}
        </span>
    {%- endfor -%}
</p>
